m]; router/norm grads sum predict+correct; accumulators pre-zeroed; fp32 math cast only at store; exact 1/2304\", \"shape_dtype_audit\": \"bases (k*rows+row)*H, activated row*H; return order/dtypes match spec; PASSED on evaluator\"}, \"per_workload\": [{\"uuid\": \"fcd64c92-9a71-592e-ab33-71843be9270f\", \"B\": 64, \"S\": 613, \"status\": \"PASSED\", \"pass\": true, \"speedup\": 4.268013674035502, \"ref_ms\": 88.068676, \"sol_ms\": 20.6345815, \"max_abs\": 0.03125, \"max_rel\": 0.0078125}, {\"uuid\": \"5834489e-1f51-5995-b499-8765bd31a705\", \"B\": 64, \"S\": 128, \"status\": \"PASSED\", \"pass\": true, \"speedup\": 4.363762324057112, \"ref_ms\": 18.9612455, \"sol_ms\": 4.34516, \"max_abs\": 0.03125, \"max_rel\": 0.0078125}, {\"uuid\": \"f2508211-757f-5c74-a08a-621ce070f77d\", \"B\": 4, \"S\": 256, \"status\": \"PASSED\", \"pass\": true, \"speedup\": 4.351436603181414, \"ref_ms\": 2.890779, \"sol_ms\": 0.6643275, \"max_abs\": 0.03125, \"max_rel\": 0.007751937955617905}, {\"uuid\": \"e9c4303d-4391-5cb3-a6e1-674c1d19bbfd\", \"B\": 64, \"S\": 256, \"status\": \"PASSED\", \"pass\": true, \"speedup\": 4.276650719493298, \"ref_ms\": 37.1535635, \"sol_ms\": 8.6875375, \"max_abs\": 0.03125, \"max_rel\": 0.0078125}, {\"uuid\": \"a6c812e5-eb06-5abe-a527-84583b7e08ba\", \"B\": 8, \"S\": 373, \"status\": \"PASSED\", \"pass\": true, \"speedup\": 4.316672500584138, \"ref_ms\": 7.2327855, \"sol_ms\": 1.6755465, \"max_abs\": 0.03125, \"max_rel\": 0.0078125}], \"geomean_speedup\": 4.315135988894236, \"all_pass\": true, \"decision\": \"keep\", \"reason\": \"FIRST WORKING CANDIDATE. 5/5 PASSED, geomean 4.3151x. Confirms the list-comprehension root cause and the H1 fusion hypothesis. max_abs 0.03125 within per-workload atol margins at match_ratio 0.98/0.99; max_rel ~0.0078 << 0.05. New baseline/best. Next: perf tuning (Design B row-blocking to cut atomic contention on grad_rw/grad_nw; BLOCK/num_warps sweep), one change per candidate.\", \"cumulative_evals\": 6, \"skills_used\": [], \"t