8/32); then **Design B row-blocking** to amortize the weight-grad atomics; then two-stage reduction if atomics still dominate. Only a candidate beating 4.6099× gets promoted; else c007 stays.\n\nNo `final` run; no fallback used. Stopping now."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":184283,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":4871,"output_tokens":0},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"e9806933-2899-41b5-90ed-01d25aa07f47","uuid":"c0ef71f6-4671-424e-8667-c7f29659ce87","timestamp":"2026-09-17T20:36:30.679Z"}
