r/dtypes match; PASSED on evaluator\"}, \"per_workload\": [{\"uuid\": \"fcd64c92-9a71-592e-ab33-71843be9270f\", \"B\": 64, \"S\": 613, \"status\": \"PASSED\", \"pass\": true, \"speedup\": 8.615327335024078, \"ref_ms\": 88.068676, \"sol_ms\": 10.222325, \"max_abs\": 0.03125, \"max_rel\": 0.0078125}, {\"uuid\": \"5834489e-1f51-5995-b499-8765bd31a705\", \"B\": 64, \"S\": 128, \"status\": \"PASSED\", \"pass\": true, \"speedup\": 8.276720023850752, \"ref_ms\": 18.9612455, \"sol_ms\": 2.290913, \"max_abs\": 0.03125, \"max_rel\": 0.0078125}, {\"uuid\": \"f2508211-757f-5c74-a08a-621ce070f77d\", \"B\": 4, \"S\": 256, \"status\": \"PASSED\", \"pass\": true, \"speedup\": 5.685931995696379, \"ref_ms\": 2.890779, \"sol_ms\": 0.508409, \"max_abs\": 0.03125, \"max_rel\": 0.007751937955617905}, {\"uuid\": \"e9c4303d-4391-5cb3-a6e1-674c1d19bbfd\", \"B\": 64, \"S\": 256, \"status\": \"PASSED\", \"pass\": true, \"speedup\": 8.517697860726875, \"ref_ms\": 37.1535635, \"sol_ms\": 4.3619255, \"max_abs\": 0.03125, \"max_rel\": 0.0078125}, {\"uuid\": \"a6c812e5-eb06-5abe-a527-84583b7e08ba\", \"B\": 8, \"S\": 373, \"status\": \"PASSED\", \"pass\": true, \"speedup\": 7.110471174850227, \"ref_ms\": 7.2327855, \"sol_ms\": 1.017202, \"max_abs\": 0.03125, \"max_rel\": 0.0078125}], \"geomean_speedup\": 7.551451960435094, \"all_pass\": true, \"decision\": \"keep\", \"reason\": \"BIG WIN: 5/5 PASSED, geomean 7.5515x vs c007 4.6099x (+64%). Confirms H4 atomics hypothesis - atomic contention on grad_rw/grad_nw was a major cost. Large-row workloads jump most (fcd64c92 4.57->8.62x, e9c4303d 4.56->8.52x); small-B f2508211 gains least (4.68->5.69x, fewer rows per program to amortize + tail waste). New best. Next: sweep BLOCK_ROWS (16/32) and num_warps to push further; small-B workloads may prefer smaller BLOCK_ROWS but one immutable config must serve all 5.\", \"cumulative_evals\": 8, \"skills_used\": [], \"tokens_note\": \"eval 8 of 100 budget; new best geomean 7.5515x\"}"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_se