ibly exact H-tiling to cut the ~44% masked-lane waste. Only a candidate beating 7.5515× gets promoted; else c008 stays.\n\nNote: my first write of this candidate contained a stray placeholder helper; I caught it before evaluating and fully rewrote the file clean, so only the correct c008 source was ever evaluated. No `final` run; no fallback used. Stopping now."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":210515,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":4871,"output_tokens":0},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"e9806933-2899-41b5-90ed-01d25aa07f47","uuid":"6e39908f-461c-4b9d-934a-d5f69e7e1e6b","timestamp":"2026-09-17T20:45:04.689Z"}
