local fp32 registers/SRAM across the 8 rows and flushed with a SINGLE atomic set per program (~8x fewer atomics). Per-row math is the c007 single-pass H-resident body. row<rows guard via lmask. No list comprehensions.\", \"hypothesis\": \"H4 atomics: amortizing grad_rw/grad_nw atomics across 8 rows + loading shared weights once cuts atomic contention (esp. on the 39232-row workload) and improves geomean\", \"change_from_parent\": \"single-row single-pass -> 8-row-blocked program with local accumulation + single atomic flush; grid shrinks 8x\", \"validation\": {\"analytic_checks\": \"per-row math identical to c007 (verified); local accumulators sum correctly across rows (grad_rw/grad_nw/gpcw/gccw are pure sums over rows); lmask=m&(row<rows) prevents OOB and contributes 0 to accumulators for tail rows; idx-subtraction ordering and g_flat index order preserved\", \"shape_dtype_audit\": \"bases (k*rows+row)*H; single flush writes match [3,H]/[H]/[9,3]/[3,3]; return order/dtypes match; PASSED on evaluator\"}, \"per_workload\": [{\"uuid\": \"fcd64c92-9a71-592e-ab33-71843be9270f\", \"B\": 64, \"S\": 613, \"status\": \"PASSED\", \"pass\": true, \"speedup\": 8.615327335024078, \"ref_ms\": 88.068676, \"sol_ms\": 10.222325, \"max_abs\": 0.03125, \"max_rel\": 0.0078125}, {\"uuid\": \"5834489e-1f51-5995-b499-8765bd31a705\", \"B\": 64, \"S\": 128, \"status\": \"PASSED\", \"pass\": true, \"speedup\": 8.276720023850752, \"ref_ms\": 18.9612455, \"sol_ms\": 2.290913, \"max_abs\": 0.03125, \"max_rel\": 0.0078125}, {\"uuid\": \"f2508211-757f-5c74-a08a-621ce070f77d\", \"B\": 4, \"S\": 256, \"status\": \"PASSED\", \"pass\": true, \"speedup\": 5.685931995696379, \"ref_ms\": 2.890779, \"sol_ms\": 0.508409, \"max_abs\": 0.03125, \"max_rel\": 0.007751937955617905}, {\"uuid\": \"e9c4303d-4391-5cb3-a6e1-674c1d19bbfd\", \"B\": 64, \"S\": 256, \"status\": \"PASSED\", \"pass\": true, \"speedup\": 8.517697860726875, \"ref_ms\": 37.1535635, \"sol_ms\": 4.3619255, \"max_abs\": 0.03125, \"max_rel\": 