very workload jumped ~1.5x. Same numerics. New best. Next c013: try num_warps=4 to see if the occupancy trend continues, or 32 to bound it; and reconsider BLOCK_ROWS at the new warp count (interactions).\", \"cumulative_evals\": 11, \"cumulative_eval_attempts\": 12, \"skills_used\": [], \"tokens_note\": \"eval 11 (attempt 12); new best geomean 12.0211x\"}","+{\"candidate\": \"c013\", \"parent\": \"c012\", \"source_hash\": \"d19095423b97fba6ce78564a677cad8788a0b15191c01dcd4b8fdd844c861992\", \"design\": \"Design B row-blocking, identical kernel/math to c012 (BLOCK_ROWS=16, BLOCK_H=4096); only num_warps 8 -> 4.\", \"hypothesis\": \"num_warps=4 continues the occupancy trend seen at 16->8 and improves further\", \"change_from_parent\": \"num_warps 8 -> 4 (pure config; math identical)\", \"validation\": {\"analytic_checks\": \"kernel math identical to c012 (verified); config-only\", \"shape_dtype_audit\": \"unchanged; PASSED on evaluator\"}, \"per_workload\": [{\"uuid\": \"fcd64c92-9a71-592e-ab33-71843be9270f\", \"B\": 64, \"S\": 613, \"status\": \"PASSED\", \"pass\": true, \"speedup\": 7.9451, \"ref_ms\": 88.068676, \"sol_ms\": 11.084651, \"max_abs\": 0.03125, \"max_rel\": 0.0078125}, {\"uuid\": \"5834489e-1f51-5995-b499-8765bd31a705\", \"B\": 64, \"S\": 128, \"status\": \"PASSED\", \"pass\": true, \"speedup\": 7.3109, \"ref_ms\": 18.9612455, \"sol_ms\": 2.593548, \"max_abs\": 0.03125, \"max_rel\": 0.0078125}, {\"uuid\": \"f2508211-757f-5c74-a08a-621ce070f77d\", \"B\": 4, \"S\": 256, \"status\": \"PASSED\", \"pass\": true, \"speedup\": 5.8545, \"ref_ms\": 2.890779, \"sol_ms\": 0.493769, \"max_abs\": 0.03125, \"max_rel\": 0.007751937955617905}, {\"uuid\": \"e9c4303d-4391-5cb3-a6e1-674c1d19bbfd\", \"B\": 64, \"S\": 256, \"status\": \"PASSED\", \"pass\": true, \"speedup\": 7.6881, \"ref_ms\": 37.1535635, \"sol_ms\": 4.832576, \"max_abs\": 0.03125, \"max_rel\": 0.0078125}, {\"uuid\": \"a6c812e5-eb06-5abe-a527-84583b7e08ba\", \"B\": 8, \"S\": 373, \"status\": \"PASSED\", \"p